From 796afe53356dc31c0250c0eabb02ce25b20fbd73 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: phlink <dev@phlink.local>
Date: Thu, 30 Apr 2026 00:34:12 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] phlink: phase 10.02d PayloadFetcher + StagedPayload

PayloadFetcher: downloads an update payload zip via
network::SimpleURLLoader::DownloadToFile and verifies size + SHA-256
against targets.json on a MayBlock thread. On failure (network, length
mismatch, hash mismatch, or I/O error) the staged file is deleted.

StagedPayload: writes/reads Updates/staged.json
({schema, version, payload_path, verified_at}) atomically via
ImportantFileWriter; the platform-specific update helper (10-03/04/05)
will pick this up at next launch.

22/22 phlink_updater_unittests pass (4 new payload-fetcher + 4 new
staged-payload). Refs phlink phase 10-02d.
